# Project Map

Before broad exploration, read `docs/architecture/project-map.md`.

Use exact search for known symbols. Use semantic search for "how does this work?"
questions. Start in the subdirectory that owns the change.

Do not open generated files, lock files, build outputs, or vendored code unless
the task specifically requires them.
